Subject: [PATCH 2/6] tf-1.1.0: a direct read the file system refuses goes
 through the page cache (cherry-pick of upstream 6bb9daaca2, merge c5085e1e,
 PR #916)

An O_DIRECT read failed with EINVAL clears O_DIRECT on the descriptor and
retries through the page cache instead of failing the checkpoint load.
File had drifted from the fix's parent (a test rewritten to open its page-cache
reference directly); the fix's hunks did not overlap the drift and applied
clean with git apply --check.

