grammarCompiler; grammar vocabulary comes from the loaded tokenizer through the
family vtable (model_text.zig vocab_size, hf_text.zig vocabFn), so the
config.json lookup that refused Nemotron Omni does not exist here. vocabSize()
is upstream API parity for the eventual full rebase; nothing calls it yet.

